  "proof_inventory": {
    "centered_identity": "Subtype extensionality and same GammaP0/A0 inclusion restrictions yield A0 GammaP0=GammaP0 A0 and A0^2+GammaP0^2=I on EXACT HP0.",
    "generic_real_L2": "Use two canonical positive complex lifts of SAME G,D. Full complex-vector action on real/imaginary parts lifts G^2D=DG^2. Internal canonical complex/real CFC instances,positive-root uniqueness sqrt(Gc^2)=Gc and functional calculus commute theorem give same Gc Dc commutation. Norm-preserving real embedding is injective,so descend to exact real operators. Arbitrary measure retained; no finite dimension or nontriviality.",
    "genuine_Test": "Original caller inputs invoke current actual main once,retaining identical witnesses. Commuting selfadjoint A0,Inv give K selfadjoint. Two applications of right inverse yield GammaP0^2 Inv^2=I; commuting A0,Inv gives K^2=A0^2 Inv^2; exact square identity proves I+K^2=Inv^2. No theorem target or separate algebraic producer is supplied as a premise.",
    "inherited_tail": "Same S,e,U,T,Gamma,q,GammaP0,Inv,B0,V0,R and every globally centered joint f endpoint retained. Hperp=ker conditional P; HP0 centered macro; no onto V0/reverse polar product claim.",
    "internal_positive_IplusT": "Symmetry from explicit IsSelfAdjoint.one(operatorType).add hTs; quadratic positivity follows <(I+T)u,u>=||u||^2+<Tu,u> >=||u||^2-||Tu||||u||>=0 from inherited SAME T contraction. No new caller binder.",
    "same_inverse": "Star of inherited Inv GammaP0=I and GammaP0 positivity gives GammaP0 Inv*=I. Left-inverse multiplication proves Inv*=Inv. Both genuine inverse identities plus centered commutation prove A0 Inv=Inv A0. Full HP inverse never asserted.",
    "same_root_commutation": "Inherited SAME Gamma^2=I-T^2 commutes algebraically with I+T. Generic leaf applies to that Gamma and internally positive I+T; cancel additive Gamma to get Gamma T=T Gamma.",
    "transport_and_centered_restriction": "Conjugation by SAME onto e preserves multiplication. Tq=q implies SAME AqP=qP. Selfadjoint symmetry preserves exact ker(innerSL qP); A0 is actual codRestrict of A.comp inclusion,with rfl inclusion identity and internally inherited Hilbert/complete structure."
  },
